        The Illusion of Readiness in Health AI
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Gu%2C+Y">Yu Gu</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Fu%2C+J">Jingjing Fu</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Liu%2C+X">Xiaodong Liu</a>, 
      
